<title>JAPAN: Nishi-Nippon Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nishi-Nippon Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    72.93		vs	   84.24</p>
<p> Operating	   13.61		vs	   13.29</p>
<p> Current		8.97		vs	    5.98</p>
<p> Net		    8.78		vs	    2.60</p>
<p> EPS		   21.68 yen	  vs	    6.61 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    462 million	  vs	 394 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nishi-Nippon Bank Ltd is a regional bank with main business territory in Kyushu.</p>
</text>
